** If any potential issues arise at parallel tangent edges, investigate the possibility of numerical error
 in the computespaceparallel_oo function

 An AI code review suggests this:
Guard against zero/near-zero norms when orthonormalizing
Your projection + normalization can fail if parallel_transport returns a vector nearly parallel to t1 (or numerically zero after projection). Normalization will divide by a tiny number → NaNs.
